{% comment %} Shipping Policy - Glamora (India only, no international shipping) {% endcomment %}

<p>At Glamora, we aim for prompt delivery of our cosmetic products through trusted courier partners. This policy explains how we ship orders and what you can expect.</p>

<h2 id="delivery-area">Delivery Area</h2>
<p>We currently ship only within India. All orders are delivered across the country through our courier partners.</p>

<h2 id="delivery-timeline">Delivery Timeline</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Orders will be dispatched within <strong>3 working days</strong> of order confirmation.</li>
  <li>Delivery typically takes <strong>7–14 working days</strong> across India, depending on your location.</li>
  <li>Deliveries are made on <strong>business days only</strong> (excluding Sundays and national holidays).</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="shipping-charges">Shipping Charges</h2>
<p>A shipping fee applies for orders below <strong>Rs. 999</strong>. Orders of Rs. 999 and above may qualify for free shipping as per our current offers. The applicable shipping charge is shown at checkout before you place your order.</p>

<h2 id="delayed-orders">Delayed Orders</h2>
<p>In case of delays due to unforeseen circumstances (e.g., natural disasters, political disruptions, or carrier issues), we will inform you via email and SMS. Please ensure your contact details are accurate when placing an order so we can keep you updated.</p>

<h2 id="tracking-and-updates">Tracking and Updates</h2>
<p>Once your order is shipped, you will receive tracking details via email and SMS so you can follow your delivery. If you have any questions about your shipment, contact our customer care team.</p>

<p>If you have any questions regarding shipping, our friendly customer support team is here to help. Reach us at <a href="mailto:care@glamoracosmetics.co.in">care@glamoracosmetics.co.in</a> or call <strong>+91 86507 51707</strong>.</p>
